#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:2
msgid "HPE 3PAR / Primera Storage"
msgstr "HPE 3PAR / Primera Almacenamiento"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| integrates with HPE 3PAR and Primera storage arrays, providing "
"synchronized visibility into storage groups (CPGs), volumes, hosts, and host"
" sets. Once integrated, |morpheus| can create datastores by mapping volumes "
"to host groups and presenting LUNs automatically."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| integrates con HPE 3PAR y Primera storage arrays, providing "
"synchronized visibility en storage groups (CPGs), volúmenes, hosts, y host "
"establece. Once integrated, |morpheus| puede crear datastores por mapping "
"volúmenes a host groups y presenting LUNs automáticamente."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:9
msgid ""
"The integration communicates with the 3PAR Web Services API (WSAPI) over "
"HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"El integration communicates con el 3PAR Web Servicios API (WSAPI) sobre "
"HTTPS."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:12
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Requisitos previos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:14
msgid "HPE 3PAR OS 3.2.1 or later, or HPE Primera OS"
msgstr "HPE 3PAR OS 3.2.1 o later, o HPE Primera OS"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:15
msgid "WSAPI service enabled on the array (default port: 8008 for HTTPS)"
msgstr ""
"WSAPI servicio habilitado en el array (predeterminado puerto: 8008 para "
"HTTPS)"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:16
msgid "An administrative user account with API access"
msgstr "Un administrative usuario account con API acceso"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:17
msgid ""
"Network connectivity from the |morpheus| appliance to the 3PAR WSAPI "
"endpoint"
msgstr "Red connectivity desde el |morpheus| appliance al 3PAR WSAPI endpoint"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:20
msgid "Adding an HPE 3PAR Storage Server"
msgstr "Adding un HPE 3PAR Almacenamiento Servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:22
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Storage``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Storage``"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:23
msgid "Select the **SERVERS** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **SERVERS** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:24
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:70
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:25
msgid "From the ADD STORAGE SERVER wizard, fill in the following:"
msgstr "Desde el ADD STORAGE SERVER wizard, fill en el siguiente:"

