#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:46
msgid "**Host Sets** — Logical groupings of hosts for shared volume access"
msgstr "**Host Sets** — Logical groupings de hosts para shared volumen acceso"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:49
msgid "Synced Data"
msgstr "Synced Datos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:52
msgid "CPG Groups"
msgstr "CPG Groups"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:52
msgid ""
"Common Provisioning Groups define the underlying disk configuration for "
"volumes. CPGs are synced and displayed as Storage Groups."
msgstr ""
"Común Aprovisionamiento Grupos define el underlying disco configuración para"
" volúmenes. CPGs son sincronizado y mostrado como Almacenamiento Grupos."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:55
msgid "Volumes"
msgstr "Volumes"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:55
msgid ""
"Virtual volumes on the 3PAR array are synced and visible under the storage "
"server's Volumes tab."
msgstr ""
"Virtual volúmenes en el 3PAR array son sincronizado y visible bajo el "
"storage servidor's Volumes pestaña."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:58
msgid "Hosts"
msgstr "Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:58
msgid ""
"Individual host registrations (with WWN/IQN identifiers) connected to the "
"array."
msgstr ""
"Individual host registrations (con WWN/IQN identifiers) conectado un el "
"array."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:61
msgid "Host Sets"
msgstr "Host Sets"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:61
msgid "Groups of hosts that share volume access, used for LUN presentation."
msgstr ""
"Grupos de hosts ese share volumen acceso, utilizado para LUN presentation."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:64
msgid "Creating a Datastore"
msgstr "Creating un Almacén de datos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:66
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can create datastores on HPE 3PAR by mapping a volume to a host "
"group (creating a vLUN). To create a datastore:"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede crear datastores en HPE 3PAR por mapping un volumen a un "
"host group (creating un vLUN). A crear un datastore:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:68
msgid "Navigate to the 3PAR storage server detail page"
msgstr "Navegue un el 3PAR storage server detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:69
msgid "Select the **DATASTORES** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **DATASTORES** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:71
msgid "Configure the following fields:"
msgstr "Configure lo siguiente campos:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:74
msgid "Name for the new datastore."
msgstr "Nombre para el nuevo datastore."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:75
msgid "STORAGE GROUP"
msgstr "STORAGE GROUP"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:76
msgid "Select the CPG (Common Provisioning Group) to provision from."
msgstr "Seleccionar el CPG (Común Aprovisionamiento Grupo) a provision desde."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:77
msgid "HOST GROUP"
msgstr "HOST GROUP"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:78
msgid "Select the Host Set to present the volume to."
msgstr "Seleccionar el Host Establecer a present el volumen a."

