msgid "VOLUME"
msgstr "VOLUME"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:80
msgid "Select or create the volume to map."
msgstr "Seleccionar o crear el volumen a mapear."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:82
msgid "The following options are available when creating a new volume:"
msgstr ""
"Lo siguiente opciones están disponibles cuando creating un nuevo volumen:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:89
msgid "DISK TYPE"
msgstr "DISK TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:85
msgid "The physical disk type for the volume:"
msgstr "El physical disco tipo para el volumen:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:87
msgid "**Fibre Channel** — High-performance FC disks"
msgstr "**Fibre Channel** — Alto-rendimiento FC discos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:88
msgid "**Near Line** — High-capacity NL-SAS disks"
msgstr "**Near Line** — Alto-capacidad NL-SAS discos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:89
msgid "**SSD** — Solid-state drives for maximum performance"
msgstr "**SSD** — Solid-estado drives para máximo rendimiento"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:97
msgid "RAID TYPE"
msgstr "RAID TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:92
msgid "The RAID level for data protection:"
msgstr "El RAID nivel para datos protection:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:94
msgid "**Raid 0** — Striping only (no redundancy)"
msgstr "**Raid 0** — Striping solo (no redundancia)"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:95
msgid "**Raid 1** — Mirroring"
msgstr "**Raid 1** — Mirroring"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:96
msgid "**Raid 5** — Striping with single parity"
msgstr "**Raid 5** — Striping con single parity"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:97
msgid "**Raid 6** — Striping with dual parity"
msgstr "**Raid 6** — Striping con dual parity"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:105
msgid "PROVISIONING TYPE"
msgstr "PROVISIONING TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:100
msgid "How space is allocated on the array:"
msgstr "Cómo space es allocated en el array:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:102
msgid "**FULL** — Fully provisioned (thick)"
msgstr "**FULL** — Fully aprovisionado (thick)"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:103
msgid "**TPVV** — Thin Provisioned Virtual Volume"
msgstr "**TPVV** — Thin Aprovisionado Virtual Volume"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:104
msgid "**SNP** — Snapshot space"
msgstr "**SNP** — Snapshot space"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:105
msgid "**PEER** — Peer persistence volume"
msgstr "**PEER** — Peer persistence volumen"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:112
msgid "HA TYPE"
msgstr "HA TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:108
msgid "The high-availability layout preference:"
msgstr "El alto-disponibilidad layout preference:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:110
msgid "**PORT** — Distribute across ports"
msgstr "**PORT** — Distribute a través de puertos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:111
msgid "**CAGE** — Distribute across drive cages"
msgstr "**CAGE** — Distribute a través de drive cages"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:112
msgid "**MAG** — Distribute across magazines"
msgstr "**MAG** — Distribute a través de magazines"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:116
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will create a vLUN (virtual LUN) export on the 3PAR array, "
"mapping the specified volume to the selected host set with auto-LUN "
"assignment."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| será crear un vLUN (virtual LUN) export en el 3PAR array, mapping"
" el specified volumen al seleccionado host establecer con auto-LUN "
"assignment."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:119
msgid "Refresh and Status"
msgstr "Refresh y Estado"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:121
msgid ""
"The 3PAR integration refreshes automatically on a scheduled interval. During"
" a refresh, |morpheus| will:"
msgstr ""
"El 3PAR integration refreshes automáticamente en un scheduled interval. "
"Durante un refresh, |morpheus| será:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:123
msgid "Verify API connectivity"
msgstr "Verificar API connectivity"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:124
msgid "Re-sync CPG groups, volumes, hosts, and host sets"
msgstr "Re-sync CPG groups, volúmenes, hosts, y host establece"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:125
msgid "Update the storage server status indicator"
msgstr "Update el storage servidor estado indicator"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:127
msgid "Status indicators:"
msgstr "Estado indicators:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:129
msgid "**OK** — Connected and syncing normally"
msgstr "**OK** — Conectado y syncing normally"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:130
msgid "**Error** — Connection failure or invalid credentials"
msgstr "**Error** — Conexión fallo o inválido credentials"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:131
msgid "**Offline** — WSAPI endpoint is not reachable"
msgstr "**Offline** — WSAPI endpoint es no reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:133
msgid ""
"If an error occurs, a health alarm is raised and displayed on the storage "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Si un error occurs, un health alarm es raised y mostrado en el storage "
"servidor."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:135
msgid ""
"The 3PAR integration uses token-based authentication. The API token is "
"obtained at each sync interval and expires automatically."
msgstr ""
"El 3PAR integration usa token-based autenticación. El API token es obtained "
"en cada sync interval y expires automáticamente."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:138
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solución de problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:140
msgid ""
"**\"Error connecting to 3par\"** — Verify the WSAPI URL is correct and the "
"port (typically 8008) is accessible from the |morpheus| appliance."
msgstr ""
"**\"Error connecting to 3par\"** — Verificar el WSAPI URL es correct y el "
"puerto (típicamente 8008) es accessible desde el |morpheus| appliance."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:141
msgid ""
"**\"unauthorized - invalid credentials\"** — Confirm the username and "
"password have API access on the array."
msgstr ""
"**\"unauthorized - invalid credentials\"** — Confirmar el nombre de usuario "
"y contraseña tienen API acceso en el array."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/hpe_3par.rst:142
msgid ""
"**\"3par not found - invalid host\"** — The WSAPI service may not be running"
" on the target. Verify using ``https://<array-ip>:8008/api/v1/credentials`` "
"in a browser."
msgstr ""
"**\"3par not found - invalid host\"** — El WSAPI servicio puede no be "
"ejecutando en el destino. Verificar usando ``https://<array-"
"ip>:8008/api/v1/credentials`` en un browser."
